tes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x3tzcFfdokGn5d6iM9S0MceaFm5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x3tzcFfdokGn5d6iM9S0MceaFm5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"782818","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen continues his battle with an Akuma that has leveled up and gained the power to take on a person's appearance and powers.  Meanwhile, Kanda hears from the \"Ghost\" of Mater the history of the town and the Dolls they made to cheer themselves up.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qwiDU3MI0JUGDB1WvipfiRrXzB1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwiDU3MI0JUGDB1WvipfiRrXzB1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"782819","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The adventure in Mater draws to a close as Allen and Kanda discover the truth of who the Doll actually is and then battle the level 2 Akuma for possession of the Innocence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uNviXSJmBa3KwSsC4rvdvwuUeuw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uNviXSJmBa3KwSsC4rvdvwuUeuw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"782820","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"On his way back to the Black Order headquarters from Mater, Allen meets a boy named Jean.  Jean and his friends have organized a patrol to search for Akuma within the town.  Allen warns the boy that this is dangerous, but Jean won't listen.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vuKzv7U0CWRlcF6DTN4CB0nreAp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vuKzv7U0CWRlcF6DTN4CB0nreAp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"782821","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen's past is revealed as he confronts the Earl of the millennium, who wants to kill Jean for causing problems with his patrol and calling the Earl \"a bad guy\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6JLw1qlfQshEOn6SA7bWPgMXpSH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6JLw1qlfQshEOn6SA7bWPgMXpSH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"782822","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen still feels like a stranger at Black Order headquarters, and the young exorcist just can’t shake the feeling that he is being kept in the dark about certain happenings.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-11-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ydB9HZW8jTvLWgcLOJFzGUnDuMW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ydB9HZW8jTvLWgcLOJFzGUnDuMW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"782823","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen and Lenalee investigate a town where time repeats, but a gang of Akuma is hell-bent on making sure they recover the missing Innocence before the exorcists do.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-11-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Q2UabQjM9HUVsvUtvyDQ5J8pwz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Q2UabQjM9HUVsvUtvyDQ5J8pwz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"782824","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen and Lenalee resolve to help Miranda in order to prevent time from repeating itself. Unbeknownst to them, Road has been watching their every move and has special plans for them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h0wqZTkxnZenAlT1cUWVwFkfxcD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0wqZTkxnZenAlT1cUWVwFkfxcD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"782825","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Road Kamelot has arrived to stop Allen and Lenalee from recovering the Innocence and halting the cruel cycle of repetition plaguing the town.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/piswdN2fwiAJLWzKfFfOjkNoyS8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/piswdN2fwiAJLWzKfFfOjkNoyS8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"782826","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Road reveals something about the Millennium Earl’s grand scheme while battling the exorcists. Can Miranda harness her bizarre powers in time to save her new friends?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7OxLEeU1oAxK3r7JRLwAYLrUbaj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7OxLEeU1oAxK3r7JRLwAYLrUbaj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"782827","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battle with Road is finally over and Allen is unsure on his reasons for becoming an exorcist, but after meeting a new exorcist partner, Lavi, his sense of reason returns to him by understanding the significance of wearing the exorcist uniform.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wODtEYcWNQElFCnew06htBpJFgf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wODtEYcWNQElFCnew06htBpJFgf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"782828","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen, Lavi, and Kanda investigate a region battered by violent weather changes. The exorcists believe Innocence may be to blame, but some locals put their faith in a mysterious legend.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-01-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/abgPUB1cLMiVmGIxI5OpfzGLXAB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abgPUB1cLMiVmGIxI5OpfzGLXAB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"782829","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen, Lavi and Kanda continue their search for the Leaf of Revival, which they assume to be the Innocence. After realizing it is Innocence after all, the three Level 2 Akuma attack to retrieve it from them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-01-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mgW27cEiYtOYcffdKIao2lthcEk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mgW27cEiYtOYcffdKIao2lthcEk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"782830","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While searching for an Innocence in Rome, Kanda encounters a mysterious swordsman named Victorio, whose power is unbelievably strong. When Kanda hasn't returned after a while, Komui asks Allen and Lenalee to go to Rome to investigate why Kanda is taking so long, thus they learn the history of Victorio and the Princess, whom he vowed to always fight for.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-01-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wdrda7l7MRTijj4bdjT95RKZnNW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wdrda7l7MRTijj4bdjT95RKZnNW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"782831","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen, Lenalee and Kanda find themselves in a predicament when they battle Victorio. How can they stop someone who apparently cannot die from shear wounds?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-01-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wxPMZTIcpNIzhEputonC7l0L3JU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wxPMZTIcpNIzhEputonC7l0L3JU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"782832","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Driven by suspicion, Lenalee’s brother unleashes Sir Komlin the Third. As the giant robot wreaks havoc, a threat with intentions born of the world’s greatest evil goes unnoticed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-02-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wJvaDA02vItNOUMm4qMTuqEDcYm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wJvaDA02vItNOUMm4qMTuqEDcYm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"782833","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While on a mission to search for General Cross, Allen is beseeched by several villagers complaining about a \"vampire problem.\" Soon after the ruckus, Lavi and Bookman join Allen on his new mission.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-02-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i1tRodmIzcvgS4lmDLHNlOcMJgr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1tRodmIzcvgS4lmDLHNlOcMJgr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"782834","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen and Lavi decide to investigate Arystar Krory, the vampire who is supposedly terrorizing the village. They head up to Krory's castle and meet his beautiful lover, Eliade.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-02-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Agej3Sg4aU2UxkdSWUvy1gu8hqQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Agej3Sg4aU2UxkdSWUvy1gu8hqQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"782835","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Allen and Lavi discover the truth about Krory's attack on the villagers, he appears before them with an intention to fight, thus leading to a rather fierce battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-02-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cWOU8XUkrrrkyfOmJxMYa9vpLwX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cWOU8XUkrrrkyfOmJxMYa9vpLwX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"782836","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Lavi and Krory continue their battle outside the castle, Allen finds out the truth about Eliade.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-03-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mbdWJsEH9ILirZJdEB5hoQrBqfn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbdWJsEH9ILirZJdEB5hoQrBqfn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"782837","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Devastated by what he just learned about Eliade, Krory decides to fight her, despite his feelings toward her. Finally, Eliade is defeated and Krory decides to become an exorcist.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-03-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jcwdli3H75Df7gSrt5llHeoPput.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jcwdli3H75Df7gSrt5llHeoPput.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"782838","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"From the ashes of a burning castle, a new breed of warrior emerges. Gone is the vampish killer - born anew is the naïve exorcist Krory.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-03-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dvtHHYYHLVO4qOrIucR5raEyoIB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dvtHHYYHLVO4qOrIucR5raEyoIB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"782839","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen crosses paths with Yeeger - the oldest general in the Black Order. After a fierce battle, a generous meal, and a heart-rending story of loss, the exorcist’s spirit is renewed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-03-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/boQ3By72Z10vOiZOpw6PpYxuixH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/boQ3By72Z10vOiZOpw6PpYxuixH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"782840","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen longs for a father figure to illuminate his path in life, and the Millennium Earl rouses the Clan of Noah to search for the Heart of Innocence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fH4jFKENAVpyrCBLEBOqbLWWuA8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fH4jFKENAVpyrCBLEBOqbLWWuA8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"782841","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After General Yeegar's tragic death, Allen, Lenalee, Lavi and Krory are separated into two groups and sent to look for General Cross and guard him from the enemy. During this time, Allen tells Lenalee his bitter memories of Cross and the tragedy of a good friend.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gCAGhMTQfQm8wljZ4B6r0vjRvRF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gCAGhMTQfQm8wljZ4B6r0vjRvRF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"782842","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seeking the Heart of Innocence, the Clan of Noah savagely hunts down Black Order generals. Meanwhile, Krory prepares to embark upon his first solo mission.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m93uGNuKI13gAWMBATVH7wZl96G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m93uGNuKI13gAWMBATVH7wZl96G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"782843","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Millennium Earl is seen bouncing about cheerfully, answering several phone calls and confirming business deals. Allen and Lenalee arrive at Liverpool to meet Mother, who took care of Allen during his training years with General Cross, to ask her about his master's whereabouts. Both exorcists soon discover akuma in the area and a possible conspiracy at a local hospital.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fozQJkXT90LYWuFaVRaDRYcxnSv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fozQJkXT90LYWuFaVRaDRYcxnSv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"782844","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Allen comforts Lisa as she mourns her sweetheart's death, Lenalee investigates the cause of why there is a large quantity of akuma in the area, thus revealing the work of a Broker, who sells souls to the Millennium Earl. There are two suspects, the chief doctor, and a young money-hungry one. Working undercover as a nurse, Lenalee is determined to find out who.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yXS46N1lw5m8U5Xm1vyqsuL9C8S.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yXS46N1lw5m8U5Xm1vyqsuL9C8S.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"782845","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While heading off to Headquarters to become an exorcist, Miranda gets separated from her Finder escort. Here she meets a nice travelling family who takes her in, however, when Akuma discover her Innocence, they mount her but Officer Moores saves her just in enough time for Lenalee to come and rescue them both.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1hAjmCbsFt5CDeXzjh0uphFDmi5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1hAjmCbsFt5CDeXzjh0uphFDmi5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"782846","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While waiting for a ship to rendezvous with Lenalee, Allen encounters a group of wannabe pirates who claim that a pirate ship is sinking ships along the coast.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yWG3sbndsZIwVxwNtadV7Pxb7Ul.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yWG3sbndsZIwVxwNtadV7Pxb7Ul.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"782847","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While on his way to meet up with fellow exorcist, Daisya Barry, Kanda hears a rumor about \"The Forest of No Return\" and discovers he must pass through it. There, he meets a Finder named Gozu and soon comes upon a village where, according to a legend, a witch is supposed to live.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kScdgUfgkdVfHPOzhKODxPijVY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kScdgUfgkdVfHPOzhKODxPijVY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"782848","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kanda and Gozu discover the truth about the legend of the witch and Sophia's tragic past, which leads to a fierce battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xaZV4g5FtJYW9C2RWEdycQ9a9Uu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xaZV4g5FtJYW9C2RWEdycQ9a9Uu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"782849","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As she is on her way to reunite with Allen, Lenalee agrees to accompany Gozu to the next town. However, in the midst of the forest, they meet a group of stranded villagers, running away from their home because of wolf attacks. The wolf attacks are revealed to be the work of Akuma and Lenalee receives help from Suman Dark, an exorcist and long time friend, who is searching for General Zokalo.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/utH8vDMB4DAszuuoEixkvtxg8T5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/utH8vDMB4DAszuuoEixkvtxg8T5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"782850","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Continuing their search for General Cross, Allen and Lenalee get attacked by Akuma and bump into a group of Finders. Meanwhile, at another breakfast gathering, The Millennium Earl announces to the Noah Clan that he's come up with a plan to get rid of the exorcists. He gives Tyki, Jasdero and David (Twins), and Skin a card with names on it of whom he'd like them to kill and get rid of.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hNdm9VfqCXuvj4KXqzqAdigsYNW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hNdm9VfqCXuvj4KXqzqAdigsYNW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"782851","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Kanda and Daisya head out to Barcelona to meet up with General Tiedoll, Daisya reminisces about his past on how he became an exorcist and how he met General Tiedoll.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jwal5fioMlk7v9d0jYAOMhzV8Yy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jwal5fioMlk7v9d0jYAOMhzV8Yy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"782852","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Swarms of Akuma track General Tiedoll to Barcelona, and Allen and Lenalee race towards the besieged city in a fleeting attempt to save their comrades.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/slRl4VEXcRmcQfVuCnhI1S3bL4P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/slRl4VEXcRmcQfVuCnhI1S3bL4P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"782853","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Black Order suppresses the Akuma forces at Barcelona, but many are lost in battle. As Allen and Lenalee set off to find General Cross, Tiedoll searches for new recruits.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dskE3h4bxP7M9mNJZXk3pdKfeR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6dskE3h4bxP7M9mNJZXk3pdKfeR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"782854","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lavi and Krory are sent to protect Allen and Lenalee as they continue to look for General Cross. Their search is interrupted when Akuma attack a festival of roses.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k09gOn8xwBt3nUNtvPZPvQpjEwG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k09gOn8xwBt3nUNtvPZPvQpjEwG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"782855","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Stranded on a rain-drenched night, Allen and his friends are lured into a trap by a black cat, but a growling stomach may prove to be their saving grace.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tY1h8TkZE6CKMaqNXI5Nw7jX4bR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tY1h8TkZE6CKMaqNXI5Nw7jX4bR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"782856","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lulu Bell dons a disarming disguise and leads Krory into a desert ambush, setting into motion her devious plan to divide and conquer Allen and his comrades.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9FoLsXMwrc17nBbnfSmShaUZ4Iu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9FoLsXMwrc17nBbnfSmShaUZ4Iu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"782857","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Krory and Allen’s attempted rendezvous with Lavi and Lenalee is derailed by their investigation of a walking statue. Is it Innocence at work or just another trap?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cxeJe88QIBik8K1aq472IiVnN3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxeJe88QIBik8K1aq472IiVnN3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"782858","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lenalee’s condition worsens, and Lavi knows he must get her to Bookman for immediate treatment; however, his daring rescue of a damsel in distress might cost him his Innocence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w4G4RXFZdfrpi8dsyeWqXCzwj8Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4G4RXFZdfrpi8dsyeWqXCzwj8Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"782859","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"General Tiedoll enjoys painting the beautiful scenery he encounters, but Kanda is eager for action. Perhaps an Akuma outbreak at an unusual castle will satisfy both of their needs.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzNZ2FqUfXZNHNvgfi4wWFNLG7m.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzNZ2FqUfXZNHNvgfi4wWFNLG7m.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"782860","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seeking a guide to lead them through a treacherous mountain pass, Allen and Krory stumble into a devious trap. Soon they will be visited by visions of the past.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/prympdyFSWRoEMswAHMCGXI7jt2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/prympdyFSWRoEMswAHMCGXI7jt2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"782861","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Allen and his friends arrive at a village stricken by a mysterious water shortage. Their investigation leads them to a fortune teller who recognizes Lenalee from a disturbing vision.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ChRsjKrZMdGNMY5W18NO80kQSE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ChRsjKrZMdGNMY5W18NO80kQSE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"782862","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bookman and Lenalee trace the dwindling water supply back to a terrified fortune teller whose crystal ball might be an Innocence fragment.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/knkZwjeJD9KpxFP20VFNKiUU0Et.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/knkZwjeJD9KpxFP20VFNKiUU0Et.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34141/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"782863","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Before Mei Ling can begin her training as an exorcist, she must use her gift to help her new friends survive another deadly encounter with the deranged Mimi.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/41bBzvOvuPqjzgruRBHaDlfErq7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/41bBzvOvuPqjzgruRBHaDlfErq7.jpg